{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":278127,\"title\":\"Unveil: Jadewind\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"A stern officer and a sharp-witted investigator form a detective duo that solves eerie murders and uncovers corruption within the Tang Dynasty.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mW5iRPRxmKOLN5S6BV8iiqbWqyr.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u9AkHDe9oiw62hZ8muokTUWdB27.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.1,\"voteCount\":12,\"year\":2026,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":34,\"createdBy\":[\"Sen Lin Lu\"],\"networks\":[\"Youku\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CN\",\"name\":\"China\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-02-22\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1775657,\"name\":\"Yin Tao\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A7v1YmdZsRFhQP4RqDWbJW8vsqJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1879666,\"name\":\"Bai Lu\",\"character\":\"Li Peiyi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/25f4Rjwxu582cOeCpNzRJ17uW4z.jpg\"},{\"id\":3157355,\"name\":\"Wang Xingyue\",\"character\":\"Xiao Huaijin\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mi4dqtBt53fRpRWFTgCf9GHgOA7.jpg\"},{\"id\":3567741,\"name\":\"Annabel Yao\",\"character\":\"Pei Yu\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7OyuR1f3wHArvkhshAn6R1Dm8V.jpg\"},{\"id\":2937438,\"name\":\"Zhao Qing\",\"character\":\"Wu Ren\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ribX33OKeV7LLGo4N4aLW5a14Wc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1879667,\"name\":\"Zhao Yiqin\",\"character\":\"Gu Lingzhou\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5QiIAqWAAzuhbDQ9MwGTpMtUlYj.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"18izFwhQaw0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer [Eng Sub]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"r8nGp7atcwU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":63470,\"title\":\"Cheo Yong\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3m7XYqhkzP6GWRBDkPQSSMxWk53.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42608695652173917,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":131260,\"title\":\"Remember You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cIMLYz8slrLzZE3omJMChU41h0k.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.24411764705882355,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":97801,\"title\":\"Berko\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rMy1TjF4qsf4V5wZUbMxin7BEsA.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21764705882352942,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":64031,\"title\":\"Border\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wrsVRxNqIg0ybvFVOUYx9ySfgUF.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2153846153846154,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":32245,\"title\":\"Lumang Piso Para sa Puso\",\"poster\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21500000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":32001,\"title\":\"The Heaven Sword and Dragon Saber\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/39tGUuItuVvfsvlp5NkNkYU04T2.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21500000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63333,\"title\":\"The Last Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8eJf0hxgIhE6QSxbtuNCekTddy1.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21343283582089553,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":315637,\"title\":\"Sawatdee Krab -- Adventure in Thailand\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6RTBF5eqLsQ305JvIJBTS8ezD9m.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21304347826086958,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":63349,\"title\":\"The Bastard Executioner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apnKjgxmc2NtyRuII0TSQzqCs5D.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2126760563380282,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":315632,\"title\":\"Oh No, My Best Friend and I Transmigrated into a Book and Ruined the Villain!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zcFJx9kPetelPhypIPi0jYGKCHX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21250000000000002,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":283961,\"title\":\"You Are My Fateful Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zquhJjbfgYc1aMOsqZBixPDNyyy.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21132075471698114,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":32384,\"title\":\"Strange Heroes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gfH7sWOHXUaAVQzayhuFxWt4dGA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.209375,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4QJnQRHzNziOq4FZf184WBSUAlA.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"When a princess dies in a mysterious fire, officer Li Peiyi and astronomer Xiao Huaijin trace a trail of illusions to a city ward outside the palace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/du0tgEE0h3tcJDAX6G2FLRYjfhn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtime\":62},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"In Yanshou Ward, Peiyi and Huaijin's investigation uncovers a new murder, revealing a possible connection to the princess's death.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AigdjQux62e8CW6rKJjNguTmGLv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi identifies a prime suspect in Princess Wanshun's murder - but later, a hunch steers her investigation in a completely different direction.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3GNeWMYyUP7yRaPqjj6vNnhzMM0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Months after the princess's case closes, a corpse adorned with flowers is found at the palace. Peiyi and Huaijin reunite to investigate.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/idLtHgCevXKd6SnpN6h7OKVarnk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-05\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"The murder of a loan shark linked to Hanxiao leads Peiyi and Huaijin to the Xiuhong House, where other missing palace maids are being held captive.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bLnwGDnTGuVV61AYWbp5N6QF5Ae.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-06\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"After their initial attempt fails, Peiyi and Huaijin go undercover to infiltrate Xiuhong House and find a captive palace maid.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b6aOpvlzNoCUb6CgrNOlP4kEtX8.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-06\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"Disguised as a dancer, Peiyi exposes the exploitation of palace maids at Xiuhong House and discovers a high-ranking official among its clients.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xYcxO2aF7IIWLdD3JdWF6r6yvV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-07\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"After a rescue mission ends in tragedy, Peiyi uncovers irrefutable evidence, finally identifying the true killer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5TL4uSpi3bK20Ub3nDMg6e0rLGf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-07\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi suffers extreme consequences for pursuing Lu Zhenglian. But months later, a new poisoning of nobles revives the dangerous conspiracy she uncovered.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zqeQZe79wUdevoLHvtPgQ9p5CJF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-08\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi discovers the true identity of the dancers and their ties to Xiuhong House. Later, eerie crying in Hanliang Hall signals a new, haunting mystery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o0qCkGgkgbd48giUwg9ah2yCsNa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-08\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Episode 11\",\"overview\":\"An alleged haunting at Hanliang Hall draws the investigators into another case, where they learn more about the life of one of the murdered dancers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2dVwzi5uUZHZXdijPmRcuLRUtGR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-09\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Episode 12\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi and Huaijin trace the poison used on Yushu and the dancers to the Ghost Market, where their search uncovers a hidden link to Cheng'en Palace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tURjdVtWxKVvjpnsSuTyuwLB4Ph.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-09\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Episode 13\",\"overview\":\"A misunderstanding puts Peiyi and Huaijin at odds. Later, Peiyi learns about a potential suspect in Yushu's murder and goes to confront him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zV1E0bUlU62ur8uT1KkeODG5g2K.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-10\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Episode 14\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi reveals the mastermind behind Yushu's murder, but closing the case proves difficult. Later, the pair of investigators reconcile their differences.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jLkXkEHFGjiIc1LYttaTckAim4O.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Episode 15\",\"overview\":\"A death by poisoning leads Peiyi to the Imperial Medical Office, where she meets a medical worker who issues a grave warning about a seasonal illness.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f8bx6tKDgYiwn1OtdvlQeOFhk7k.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Episode 16\",\"overview\":\"As an epidemic grips the imperial palace, Peiyi risks her life to help a discredited healer find a cure — but not everyone wants her to succeed.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o24fBXf1dBQU1cgp0wZPEPLhD0B.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Episode 17\",\"overview\":\"When Peiyi investigates the prime suspect in Huang Futong's murder, she uncovers a mysterious secret about Pei Yu's childhood and true identity.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7ZariHAsIZMLjhLUNVZQWiIm9It.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-12\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Episode 18\",\"overview\":\"The investigators make a breakthrough while looking into Xia Shisan's death. On the way to the capital, Peiyi takes a detour to visit her uncle.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8EEvziLzntO6HvTXnG9zyXvmpAe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-12\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Episode 19\",\"overview\":\"When Peiyi investigates a family member's death, she grows suspicious of the victim's mentor, and sneaks into his estate to attend a mysterious ceremony.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yIXq62znGqg4BxSCrXNu9yLFkgC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Episode 20\",\"overview\":\"The widow of Peiyi's murdered relative comes forward to expose Xu Daoyin's scheme. Later, Peiyi apprehends a suspect in her family's home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xZJvBAP6ELohOjnJCuZwyswv4gO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Episode 21\",\"overview\":\"Xiao reveals his reasons for going to Xu Daoyin's mountain estate. Later, Peiyi puts herself in harm's way when she asks Mrs. Wu about her past.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rn2QDZmP9JhZKqVx1rxeQQB80aW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-14\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Episode 22\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi witnesses a tragic event that forces her to confront her family's traumatic past — and her partner Huaijin's possible link to it.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bShgk5qdrlJitMIDWyplKLAGoO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-14\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Episode 23\",\"overview\":\"When a father dies suspiciously after admitting to his controversial spiritual beliefs, Peiyi follows a lead to the palace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/55F0j3nMdQF7CA3hLWntBIyPcBW.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Episode 24\",\"overview\":\"When another palace official dies with a talisman in his mouth, Peiyi traces the case to a noblewoman whose servant gives a suspicious testimony.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/akw2KJHDBlH7i85pkb1tbcmKldZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-15\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Episode 25\",\"overview\":\"A ruse exposes Fuqu's vengeful hatred for Wang Anping. Meanwhile, Huaijin surprises Peiyi with a confession on the night of her birthday.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4wHbvRNrQKGhL9b54I09Jx5G9il.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-17\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Episode 26\",\"overview\":\"With the help of Medical Officer Zhao Yudi, Peiyi devises a cunning plan to draw out a prime murder suspect by using an antidote as bait to lure him in.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lG71VC3EY5HBdd0i0Ji8kvLCJBb.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-17\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"Episode 27\",\"overview\":\"Lv Chongshan flees when Peiyi disputes his story about her father — forcing her to seek answers from the palace.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q0tKtScAGHjMbIneNSh6tsTkyfd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-18\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"Episode 28\",\"overview\":\"As Peiyi digs for the truth, the Right Chancellor tries to stop her. Huaijin takes measures to protect his partner and the investigation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z8iFyDFwq3WdfxH8Uri0BgZd3wJ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-19\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Episode 29\",\"overview\":\"In an effort to expose the Right Chancellor, Peiyi hosts the ministers alone. But when Huaijin intervenes, it could spell the end of their partnership.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h7aisGf2wvN5yUaiU9Mc0AZ9kGI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-20\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":30,\"name\":\"Episode 30\",\"overview\":\"Still in turmoil, Huaijin assists with the year-end grand ceremony. Amid a rash of suspicious accidents, Peiyi resolves to support Consort Shu.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2sG71wFVTvlTA74Ia1VyRmZOvzU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-21\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":31,\"name\":\"Episode 31\",\"overview\":\"Ominous signs plague the palace as someone digs up an unlucky stone statue, falsifies an Astronomical Bureau report and wipes out an entire household.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eW5nlTXqmfnOb8z6FvBvmHSznT.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-22\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":32,\"name\":\"Episode 32\",\"overview\":\"Peiyi struggles with divided loyalties after interrogating Chen Lou. Later, a bizarre occurrence interrupts the dragon-dance rehearsal.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7BFOISKu7QOGMYqlGUJF11UIOAq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-22\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":33,\"name\":\"Episode 33\",\"overview\":\"Chen Luo convinces Peiyi to assist him in a risky plan: setting an elaborate trap at the palace to ensnare the Right Chancellor.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mcvkLVwEwFQHlGDxmO2F1IcD7Iv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-22\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":34,\"name\":\"Episode 34\",\"overview\":\"The truth comes out about Peiyi and Huaijin's plan. At the Lantern Festival, Peiyi takes her revenge on the Right Chancellor.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1lkXn5pe3S4bMfgvi9RUcTojoDf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-02-22\",\"runtime\":48}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2026-02-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}